QL_SECTION='<section class="section soft" id="library"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">THE QUOTE LIBRARY</p><h2>Every line worth keeping.</h2></div><div class="ql-lead"><p>We interview the people you name, on your floor. The library is everything usable that comes out of those conversations: every line transcribed, attributed, and tagged by theme, by audience, and by what it is good for.</p><p>Your writers pull from it for the length of the campaign. It is not a transcript to scrub through. <strong>It is proof, sorted.</strong></p></div><p class="ql-demo-lead"><strong>Here is a real one.</strong> Memorial Health’s emergency department campaign produced fifty-seven quotes from seven speakers. Pick what you are writing, then open a line to see everywhere it works.</p><div class="ql-filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter quotes by what you are writing"><button type="button" data-ql="all" aria-pressed="true">Everything <span>10</span></button><button type="button" data-ql="film" aria-pressed="false">The hero film <span>5</span></button><button type="button" data-ql="email" aria-pressed="false">A donor email <span>6</span></button><button type="button" data-ql="social" aria-pressed="false">A social post <span>5</span></button><button type="button" data-ql="board" aria-pressed="false">A board or major gift ask <span>4</span></button></div><p class="ql-count" aria-live="polite">Showing all 10 quotes in this sample</p><div class="tw ql-wrap"><table class="ql-table"><caption class="sr-only">Sample quote library, filterable by use</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Quote</th><th scope="col">Speaker</th><th scope="col">Theme</th><th scope="col">Length</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="ql-row" data-tags="film email social"><td class="ql-q"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="qd1"><span class="ql-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>“The service that my family received on that day, the support and the comfort that I received from the people that knew me, it was not because I am someone special, but it\'s because Memorial Hospital is some place special.”</button></td><td class="ql-sp"><strong>Pastor Joseph Ray</strong><span>Methodist Pastor, Richwood</span></td><td><span class="ql-theme">Community ownership</span></td><td class="ql-len">Medium</td></tr><tr class="ql-detail" id="qd1" data-tags="film email social" hidden><td colspan="4"><div><p><span>Best audience</span>Community and grassroots donors, general public</p><p><span>Works in</span>Hero film · Donor email · Social · Landing page</p></div></td></tr><tr class="ql-row" data-tags="email board"><td class="ql-q"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="qd2"><span class="ql-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>“A community owned hospital that is present and involved and engaged in the way that Memorial is in our community and solicits and asks for the community to be a part of it is very uncommon. It\'s very rare.”</button></td><td class="ql-sp"><strong>Adam Hodnichak</strong><span>Executive Director, Union County Foundation</span></td><td><span class="ql-theme">Community ownership</span></td><td class="ql-len">Medium</td></tr><tr class="ql-detail" id="qd2" data-tags="email board" hidden><td colspan="4"><div><p><span>Best audience</span>Major donors, board, community donors</p><p><span>Works in</span>Donor email · Board update · Major gift appeal</p></div></td></tr><tr class="ql-row" data-tags="email social film"><td class="ql-q"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="qd3"><span class="ql-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>“It was started right here by the farmers and businesses that are local. When I come to the hospital, I might run into somebody I know. In fact, almost every time I come to the hospital, I run into people I know.”</button></td><td class="ql-sp"><strong>Anthony Smith</strong><span>CEO, URE and Foundation Board</span></td><td><span class="ql-theme">Community ownership</span></td><td class="ql-len">Long</td></tr><tr class="ql-detail" id="qd3" data-tags="email social film" hidden><td colspan="4"><div><p><span>Best audience</span>Community donors, grassroots</p><p><span>Works in</span>Donor email · Social · Video</p></div></td></tr><tr class="ql-row" data-tags="board"><td class="ql-q"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="qd4"><span class="ql-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>“This is a regional health system that started out as a community hospital. It\'s run and operated locally. The decisions are all made here. I think we want to keep it that way.”</button></td><td class="ql-sp"><strong>Anthony Smith</strong><span>CEO, URE and Foundation Board</span></td><td><span class="ql-theme">Community ownership</span></td><td class="ql-len">Short</td></tr><tr class="ql-detail" id="qd4" data-tags="board" hidden><td colspan="4"><div><p><span>Best audience</span>Major donors, corporate donors</p><p><span>Works in</span>Major gift conversation · Board update</p></div></td></tr><tr class="ql-row" data-tags="film social"><td class="ql-q"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="qd5"><span class="ql-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>“Here at Memorial we see the emergency department as the front door to the hospital, and Memorial is the backbone of the community.”</button></td><td class="ql-sp"><strong>Spence Fisher</strong><span>President, Memorial Health</span></td><td><span class="ql-theme">Front door</span></td><td class="ql-len">Short</td></tr><tr class="ql-detail" id="qd5" data-tags="film social" hidden><td colspan="4"><div><p><span>Best audience</span>All audiences</p><p><span>Works in</span>Video · Social · Landing page · Pull quote</p></div></td></tr><tr class="ql-row" data-tags="social email"><td class="ql-q"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="qd6"><span class="ql-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>“As the community grows, so does demand. The time is now.”</button></td><td class="ql-sp"><strong>Anthony Smith</strong><span>CEO, URE and Foundation Board</span></td><td><span class="ql-theme">Urgency of now</span></td><td class="ql-len">Short</td></tr><tr class="ql-detail" id="qd6" data-tags="social email" hidden><td colspan="4"><div><p><span>Best audience</span>All audiences</p><p><span>Works in</span>Social · Video graphic · Email subject line</p></div></td></tr><tr class="ql-row" data-tags="social film"><td class="ql-q"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="qd7"><span class="ql-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>“Our region\'s not getting any smaller, it\'s getting much larger, and we need to be able to meet that need.”</button></td><td class="ql-sp"><strong>Anthony Smith</strong><span>CEO, URE and Foundation Board</span></td><td><span class="ql-theme">Urgency of now</span></td><td class="ql-len">Short</td></tr><tr class="ql-detail" id="qd7" data-tags="social film" hidden><td colspan="4"><div><p><span>Best audience</span>All audiences</p><p><span>Works in</span>Short video soundbite · Social</p></div></td></tr><tr class="ql-row" data-tags="email film"><td class="ql-q"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="qd8"><span class="ql-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>“I\'ve been in the community since 1987, and since then the population has more than doubled. Probably two and a half times what it was then. If you really think about it, the hospital needs to expand to meet that growth.”</button></td><td class="ql-sp"><strong>Anthony Smith</strong><span>CEO, URE and Foundation Board</span></td><td><span class="ql-theme">Urgency of now</span></td><td class="ql-len">Medium</td></tr><tr class="ql-detail" id="qd8" data-tags="email film" hidden><td colspan="4"><div><p><span>Best audience</span>Community donors, corporate donors</p><p><span>Works in</span>Donor email · Video</p></div></td></tr><tr class="ql-row" data-tags="email board"><td class="ql-q"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="qd9"><span class="ql-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>“If we didn\'t build new lines or consider the infrastructure requirements with new substations, then we definitely couldn\'t keep up. So we don\'t want to wait until the lights are going out.”</button></td><td class="ql-sp"><strong>Anthony Smith</strong><span>CEO, URE and Foundation Board</span></td><td><span class="ql-theme">Urgency of now</span></td><td class="ql-len">Medium</td></tr><tr class="ql-detail" id="qd9" data-tags="email board" hidden><td colspan="4"><div><p><span>Best audience</span>Corporate and employer donors</p><p><span>Works in</span>Business donor outreach · Thought leadership</p></div></td></tr><tr class="ql-row" data-tags="board"><td class="ql-q"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="qd10"><span class="ql-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>“We want to make sure we\'re being proactive and creating enough space for the future as opposed to just reacting to issues when they occur.”</button></td><td class="ql-sp"><strong>Spence Fisher</strong><span>President, Memorial Health</span></td><td><span class="ql-theme">Urgency of now</span></td><td class="ql-len">Short</td></tr><tr class="ql-detail" id="qd10" data-tags="board" hidden><td colspan="4"><div><p><span>Best audience</span>Major donors, board</p><p><span>Works in</span>Board deck · Leadership narrative</p></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="ql-foot">Fifty-seven of these came out of one interview day. The case statement, the gala script, the donor letter and the job post all draw from the same place.</p></div></section>'
QL_JS='<script>(function(){var bs=[].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll(".ql-filters button")),rows=[].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll(".ql-row")),c=document.querySelector(".ql-count");function close_(r){var b=r.querySelector("button"),d=document.getElementById(b.getAttribute("aria-controls"));b.setAttribute("aria-expanded","false");if(d)d.hidden=true;}function pick(k,label){var n=0;rows.forEach(function(r){var on=k==="all"||(" "+r.dataset.tags+" ").indexOf(" "+k+" ")>-1;r.hidden=!on;if(!on)close_(r);else n++;});bs.forEach(function(b){b.setAttribute("aria-pressed",b.dataset.ql===k?"true":"false");});c.textContent=k==="all"?("Showing all "+n+" quotes in this sample"):("Showing "+n+" of "+rows.length+" for "+label.toLowerCase());}bs.forEach(function(b){b.addEventListener("click",function(){pick(b.dataset.ql,b.textContent.replace(/\\s*\\d+\\s*$/,"").trim());});});rows.forEach(function(r){var b=r.querySelector("button");b.addEventListener("click",function(){var d=document.getElementById(b.getAttribute("aria-controls")),open=b.getAttribute("aria-expanded")==="true";b.setAttribute("aria-expanded",open?"false":"true");if(d)d.hidden=open;});});})();</script>'
hc=[mkhead('Pillar &amp; Frame · Campaign Stories for Healthcare · Central Ohio',
 'Pillar &amp; Frame films the interviews behind healthcare capital campaigns and clinical recruiting in Central Ohio. A hero film, three social cuts and a quote library from every project.'),
 '<body><a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a><div class="dark-top"><header class="wrap"><a class="brand" href="#main">pillar<span class="amp">&amp;</span>frame.</a><span class="location">Central Ohio</span><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#stories">Where it goes</a><a href="#pricing">Pricing</a><a href="#faq">FAQ</a>'+cta('Book a discovery call')+'</nav></header></div><main id="main">']
hc+=['<div class="dark-top"><section class="hero wrap"><p class="eyebrow pill">CAMPAIGN STORIES FOR HEALTH SYSTEMS AND HEALTHCARE FOUNDATIONS</p><h1>Nobody gives<br><span>to a floor plan.</span></h1><p class="hero-sub"><strong>They give to the nurse who tells them what the new floor will let her do.</strong></p><p class="hero-copy">You name the people worth hearing from. We handle everything after that: the scheduling, the releases, the interviews, the filming and the edit.</p><ul class="hero-benefits">'+''.join('<li>'+x+'</li>' for x in ['Move donors who have never set foot on the unit','Give the case statement something a rendering cannot','Keep the board and the campaign cabinet current','Bring clinicians to you instead of chasing them'])+'</ul><div class="cta-row">'+cta()+'<a class="secondary" href="#reel">See what comes back <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div><p class="local-promise">Local crews. <strong>No travel costs. Ever.</strong></p></section><section class="wrap reel reel-end" id="reel" aria-label="Campaign film reel">'+slot('hc-reel','Pillar & Frame · Campaign reel')+'</section></div>']
hc+=['<section class="section wrap sameness" id="why"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE ABSTRACTION PROBLEM</p><h2>A campaign is a number<br>and a rendering.</h2></div><div>'+p('The case statement leads with square footage, bed count and a construction timeline. So does everyone else asking that donor for money this year. None of it tells anybody what actually changes.')+p('The change is on the floor. It is the nurse who has worked that unit for nineteen years. The parent who drove ninety minutes each way, twice a week. The physician who can name exactly what she cannot do in the building she has.')+p('None of that is in a rendering. We go and get it, and we bring it back in a form your whole campaign can use.')+'</div></section>']
hc_problems=[('The case statement reads like a budget','Square footage, bed count and a timeline. Accurate, approved, and it moves nobody who is not already giving.'),('The gala film is a scramble','Somebody records three interviews the week before on a borrowed camera, and everyone in the room can tell.'),('The board has seen the renderings','They approved the project. They still cannot tell the story to a single person outside the room.'),('Postings do not fill clinical roles','Your best recruiters are the people already on the unit, and not one of them is on camera anywhere.')]
hc+=['<section class="section soft"><div class="wrap">'+heading('SOUND FAMILIAR?','Common problems we see')+'<div class="four-grid">'+''.join('<article class="card"><span class="card-index">0'+str(i+1)+'</span><h3>'+t+'</h3>'+p(d)+'</article>' for i,(t,d) in enumerate(hc_problems))+'</div></div></section>']
hc_gets=[('The hero film.','The piece the campaign is built around. It runs at the kickoff, the cabinet meeting, the gala and the site walk, and it sits on the campaign page for as long as the campaign runs.'),('Three social cuts.','Captioned and vertical, cut from the same interviews. They carry the campaign feed, the donor email and the job post without anyone having to make something new.'),('The quote library.','Every usable line from every interview, transcribed, attributed and sorted by theme. The case statement, the brochure, the annual report and the ask letter all pull from one place.')]
hc+=['<section class="section wrap">'+heading('WHAT YOU GET','One interview day.<br>Three things that keep working.')+'<div class="three-grid">'+''.join('<article class="card"><p class="eyebrow">0'+str(i+1)+'</p><h3>'+t+'</h3>'+p(d)+'</article>' for i,(t,d) in enumerate(hc_gets))+'</div></section>']
hc+=[QL_SECTION+QL_JS]
hc_process=[('You name the people.','The patient, the nurse, the donor, the physician. You know who they are and we do not. That is the only part of this we cannot do for you.'),('We handle everything after that.','Scheduling around clinical operations, releases and consent, the crew, the lighting, the questions and the edit. Nobody on your team has to produce anything.'),('It comes back ready to use.','The film, the three cuts and the quote library, delivered together. Your team approves it once, in one place.')]
hc+=['<section class="section wrap" id="process">'+heading('BUILT AROUND YOUR FLOOR','You pick the voices. We do the rest.')+'<p class="section-intro">Your development team is running a campaign, not a production. The process is built to take as little from them as possible.</p><div class="process-grid">'+''.join('<article><span>0'+str(i+1)+'</span><h3>'+t+'</h3>'+p(d)+'</article>' for i,(t,d) in enumerate(hc_process))+'</div><p class="guarantee">First cut in fourteen days. <strong>If it is late, you do not pay.</strong><span>The clock pauses while we wait on your approvals.</span></p></section>']
hc_usecases=[('campaign','CAPITAL CAMPAIGNS','Raises money for a building that does not exist yet','A donor cannot walk a floor that has not been poured. They can watch the person who will work on it.',['The film opens the kickoff and closes the ask','The quote library feeds the case statement and every letter after it','Cabinet members get something they can forward instead of explaining']),('recruiting','CLINICAL RECRUITING','Fills roles a posting cannot','Nurses choose a floor on culture, and culture is only visible in the people already standing on it.',['Your own clinicians say why they stayed','The cuts run behind every open req','The same interview day serves the campaign and the careers page'])]
hc+=['<section class="section results" id="stories"><div class="wrap">'+heading('WHERE IT GOES','Raise the money.<br>Fill the floor.')]
for key,label,title,desc,items in hc_usecases:
 hc+=['<article class="usecase"><div class="usecase-copy"><div><p class="eyebrow">'+label+'</p><h3>'+title+'</h3>'+p(desc)+'</div>'+ul(items)+'</div></article>']
hc+=['</div></section>']
hc+=['<section class="section wrap deadline">'+heading('THE TIMING','The people who make the case are working today.')+p('The nurse who has been on that unit for nineteen years retires. The family whose child came through moves away. The physician who can name what the building costs her takes a job somewhere else.')+p('A campaign runs for years. The voices that make it land are only available now.')+'</section>']
hc+=['<section class="section wrap" id="pricing">'+heading('PRICING','One interview day.<br>Pick what comes back.')+'<p class="section-intro">Same interviews, same deliverables, same price for every campaign. No scoping call and no proposal to wait on.</p><div class="plan-toggle" role="tablist" aria-label="Package format"><button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-written" aria-controls="panel-written" aria-selected="true">Video + written</button><button type="button" role="tab" id="tab-video" aria-controls="panel-video" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">Video only</button></div><p class="plan-note">The written material is the quote library, the campaign story page and the quote cards, all built from the same interviews. Add them later at the difference in price.</p>']
for pkey,(pfeats,pcards) in hc_plans.items():
 hc+=['<div class="pricing-grid pair" id="panel-'+pkey+'" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-'+pkey+'"'+('' if pkey=='written' else ' hidden')+'>']
 for name,price,desc,count in pcards:
  hc+=['<article class="price-card'+(' featured' if count==len(pfeats) else '')+'"><h3>'+name+'</h3><p class="price">'+price+'</p>'+p(desc)+'<ul class="feature-list">'+''.join('<li'+(' class="excluded"' if idx>=count else '')+'>'+f+'<span aria-label="'+('Included' if idx<count else 'Not included')+'">'+('\u2713' if idx<count else '\u00d7')+'</span></li>' for idx,f in enumerate(pfeats))+'</ul>'+cta('Book a discovery call')+'</article>']
 hc+=['</div>']
hc+=['<div class="included"><h3>Included in every package</h3>'+ul(['Local crews. No travel costs, ever.','Releases and consent handled before anyone is on camera','A day of interviews, scheduled around clinical operations','Interview direction so nobody has to perform','Twenty to thirty selected stills, culled and color corrected','Your organized raw footage and full transcripts','One revision round','First cut in fourteen days, guaranteed'])+'</div><div class="pricing-details"><div><h3>Capture options</h3>'+p('<strong>One interview day.</strong> Up to seven speakers, scheduled around the floor. The standard, and what every price above assumes.')+p('<strong>Two sites in one day.</strong> A main campus and a satellite, same market, shorter coverage on each. Ask.')+'</div><div><h3>Add-ons</h3><table><caption class="sr-only">Optional deliverables and pricing</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Add-on</th><th scope="col">Price</th></tr></thead><tbody>'+''.join('<tr><td>'+a+'</td><td>'+b+'</td></tr>' for a,b in hc_addons)+'</tbody></table></div></div>'+TOGGLE_JS+'</section>']
hc_terms=[('First cut in fourteen days or you do not pay.','Fourteen days after we leave, the first cut is in your hands. A day late and the project is free and you keep everything. Only that first cut carries a date, and its clock pauses on your approvals.'),('Nobody appears without a signed release.','On your forms or ours, whichever your compliance team prefers. If a participant changes their mind afterwards, they come out of the film, the cuts and the library at no charge.'),('We work around the floor, not the other way around.','Interviews are scheduled to clinical operations and moved when the floor needs them moved. No set is built in a corridor and no patient care is delayed for a camera.')]
hc+=['<section class="section soft"><div class="wrap">'+heading('TERMS','The things we guarantee.')+'<div class="three-grid">'+''.join('<article><h3>'+a+'</h3>'+p(b)+'</article>' for a,b in hc_terms)+'</div></div></section>']
hc_faqs=[('Who decides who we interview?','You do. You know which patient, which nurse and which donor carries the story, and we do not. Give us the names and we handle everything after that.'),('How do you handle patient consent?','A signed release before anyone is on camera, on your forms if your compliance team prefers them. Nothing is filmed, edited or published without one, and a participant who withdraws later comes out of every deliverable at no charge.'),('What exactly is a quote library?','Every usable line from every interview, transcribed, attributed and sorted by theme. Your writers stop scrubbing through footage looking for the sentence they half remember.'),('Can one project serve the campaign and recruiting?','Yes, and most should. The same interviews carry both, because the reason someone gives and the reason someone stays are usually the same reason.'),('Do you need our facilities or crew?','Neither. We bring the crew, the lighting and the sound, and we work in the rooms you already have.'),('What if the campaign timeline slips?','It usually does, and it does not affect the footage. Interviews filmed now are just as usable at the kickoff, the gala and the close, which is why the timing argument runs the other way.')]
hc+=['<section class="section wrap faq" id="faq">'+heading('QUESTIONS','A few things worth knowing.')+''.join('<details><summary>'+a+'</summary>'+p(b)+'</details>' for a,b in hc_faqs)+'</section><section class="closing"><div class="wrap"><h2>The people who make<br>the case are here now.</h2>'+p('Tell us who they are. We will tell you straight whether there is a film in it.')+cta()+p('One day on your floor. A film, three cuts and a library your campaign draws from for years.')+'</div></section></main><footer class="wrap"><a class="brand" href="#main">pillar<span class="amp">&amp;</span>frame.</a><p>Pillar &amp; Frame · Central Ohio · <a href="mailto:doyle@pillarandframe.com">doyle@pillarandframe.com</a> · <a href="tel:+13803240535">+1 380-324-0535</a></p><p class="legal-links"><a href="/privacy">Privacy policy</a> · <a href="/terms">Terms of service</a></p><a href="#main">Back to top ↑</a></footer><dialog id="booking" aria-labelledby="booking-title"><form method="dialog"><button class="close-dialog" aria-label="Close">×</button></form><p class="eyebrow">PILLAR &amp; FRAME · CENTRAL OHIO</p><h2 id="booking-title">Let’s talk about your campaign.</h2><p>The booking calendar did not load. Email <a href="mailto:doyle@pillarandframe.com">doyle@pillarandframe.com</a> or call <a href="tel:+13803240535">+1 380-324-0535</a> and we will get a time on the calendar.</p><form method="dialog"><button class="button">Got it</button></form></dialog><script src="/content.js"></script><script src="/media.js"></script></body></html>']
